OL,3,GNEWSANew powers to seize e-bikes that
OL,4,Aobstruct paths
OL,5,
OL,6,FEaling Council has approved new powers
OL,7,Fto seize e-bikes without a court order
OL,8,Fwhen they pose a danger to pedestrians
OL,9,For cause obstructions.
OL,11,FAt a full council meeting on 13
OL,12,FOctober, councillors voted to delegate
OL,13,Fadditional statutory powers to senior
OL,14,Fofficers as part of the council's
OL,15,Feffort to strengthen its e-bike
OL,16,Fenforcement policy.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
