OL,3,GNEWSANew powers to seize e-bikes that
OL,4,Aobstruct paths
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposed changes also require
OL,7,Fe-bike rental companies to reimburse
OL,8,Fthe council for the cost of recovery.
OL,9,FSeized e-bikes will be transported and
OL,10,Fstored in a secure council-owned garage
OL,11,Fon a housing estate.
OL,13,FVoi argued it had performed well in the
OL,14,Fborough and there were no legal grounds
OL,15,Fto exclude it.
